{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>120 five-digit numbers can be written with the digits <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8480bbc71e3fd12e3f8b749c49c06897ee7bb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,2,3,4,5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"17\" />. If we place these numbers in increasing order, then the position of the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8d13b3b216c64fadf2cf685645e3a67472c7df7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$41253$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/2/d027de6998a4dddcaa8dd6542238f6d03e4e3531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 71\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 72\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 73\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 74\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\mathrm{None\\ of\\ these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"478\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For any number in the first slot, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/2/482b0fba62fc7502e8b9fb930374b8f096a3a940.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4! = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> numbers, so any number starting with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> must greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/1/451a2fb46039d71db7c467cd84631ae5a56e47ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 * 24 = 72$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" />. After than, the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Rearrangement_inequality\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rearrangement inequality\">rearrangement inequality</a> gives us that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/8/a28083c7518b1caa7a68946519932717ff6f7fa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,\\ 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"34\" height=\"17\" /> are in order, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bdac599ba113971ee6f79aa314c581e97388e85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle 41235 &lt; 41253$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"114\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8d13b3b216c64fadf2cf685645e3a67472c7df7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$41253$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/1/2b1e977387475206cb88f3f06aacc93d0fc29ea1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$73 + 1 = 74 \\Longrightarrow \\mathrm{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"144\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"200